                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18968ba7-d265-3b2b-ad71-445906a6c3db",
                        "entry_id": "d39835be-4f96-3fb0-acb6-58695db3492c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "биол. совместное существование организмов разных видов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd08885e-0b17-4926-8e77-54f0439aaf94",
                                "sense_id": "18968ba7-d265-3b2b-ad71-445906a6c3db",
                                "text": "Иллюстрация из иной о́бласти ― симбиоз сувойки и зоохлореллы, одноклеточной инфузории с одноклеточной водорослью, кото́рая в ней живёт."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b450f83f-c7f7-3d44-a9db-087178a32349",
                        "entry_id": "d39835be-4f96-3fb0-acb6-58695db3492c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. сочетание, совместное существование чего-либо разнородного"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3732b17-0b04-4b56-8ee8-4474873df12a",
                                "sense_id": "b450f83f-c7f7-3d44-a9db-087178a32349",
                                "text": "Итак, думаю, вы догадались, что речь идет о медицинском вытрезвителе ― удивительном заведении, которое даже в названии своем несет симбиоз медицины и милиции."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c18e781-602e-46f7-a889-7f7b712a19cf",
                                "sense_id": "b450f83f-c7f7-3d44-a9db-087178a32349",
                                "text": "Тем более в нашем обществе, где правила неуниверсальны и всегда существует некий симбиоз между политической и экономической элитой."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c0cbb48-0e8d-40b0-9592-0cd6d105af6b",
                        "source_entry_id": "d39835be-4f96-3fb0-acb6-58695db3492c",
                        "target_lang_word": "symbiosis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "symbiosis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df4d0eeb-52ac-3292-902c-db087ad84a27",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac8fd00-fba9-3c5c-ae9c-21fc8051517a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A relationship of mutual benefit, especially among different species."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a11e4165-71c1-3ae1-bee8-c6c627e81fd6",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac8fd00-fba9-3c5c-ae9c-21fc8051517a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The close and long-term relationship or interaction between two or more different species in which at least one of the organisms benefit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ea491e8-ab02-3d0d-bc44-494430c854f5",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac8fd00-fba9-3c5c-ae9c-21fc8051517a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The close and long-term relationship or interaction between two or more different species in which at least one of the organisms benefit.",
                                            "The close and long-tern relationship or interaction between two or more different species in which all organisms benefit; mutualism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "especially",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e966716a-9b64-4623-97a2-1291f5ced259",
                                                "sense_id": "9ea491e8-ab02-3d0d-bc44-494430c854f5",
                                                "text": "Bees and flowers display symbiosis. The bees get nectar and the flowers get pollinated"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "825fc8a0-4b64-31bd-abbc-653c0697169f",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac8fd00-fba9-3c5c-ae9c-21fc8051517a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of people of different types, races, cultures, communities, etc., living together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bfd9cb1-b60c-3bb2-a34e-d61ef29feffd",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac8fd00-fba9-3c5c-ae9c-21fc8051517a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The occurrence of two different or opposing things in the same time and place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a5c3ae-6141-4f87-ab21-56d330f5039d",
                                                "sense_id": "2bfd9cb1-b60c-3bb2-a34e-d61ef29feffd",
                                                "text": "In this peculiar and deadly symbiosis the presence of warfare stimulates trade and the presence of trade stimulates warfare."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "23cc5169-b9ff-4d65-97db-1b26c5795a43",
                        "source_entry_id": "d39835be-4f96-3fb0-acb6-58695db3492c",
